		<Name>The Hive Navigator</Name>
		<Description>Though originally designed to lure Hive ships to their doom, this computer has been repurposed to help ships avoid an enemy's targeting technology. Though this device appears ancient and damaged, it provides potent protection, even in today's dangerous galaxy.</Description>
