		<QualityBoost>0</QualityBoost>
		<Name>Grudgehold Recordings Box Set</Name>
		<Description>It might be a challenge to find a modern video playback device compatible with these recordings, but it would be well worth the effort. The evidence of pirates forcing politicians, oligarchs, and noblemen to fight to the death represents a powerful reminder of the dangers and possibilities of anarchy. Surely visitors would come from the furthest reaches of the galaxy to watch these recordings.</Description>
		<ImageFilename>Environment/Events/the grudgehold recordings box set</ImageFilename>
	</Artifact>
