		<Name>Remnant of the Last Remnant</Name>
		<Description>In the years following the Shakturi War, the Last Remnant continued to fight against the last vestiges of the Shaktur Axis. Ragtag bands of Freedom Alliance survivors would often resort to unspeakable means to harass any enemy. This device allowed them to more easily defeat dangerous (or lucrative) targets.</Description>
